What is Intelligent Building Management Systems (IBMS)?
IBMS is a comprehensive, software driven framework that consolidates data streams from thousands of distributed devices-temperature sensors, occupancy detectors, light sensors, access control readers and energy meters-into a central intelligence hub. The hub processes raw data through machine learning models and rule based engines, generating actionable set points that automatically adjust heating, cooling, lighting levels, ventilation rates and security protocols. The result is a building that responds to its occupants and external conditions in near real time, optimizing energy use while preserving comfort.
