•	Asia Pacific: Rapid urbanisation, high rise construction and government backed smart city roadmaps make APAC the fastest growing region, with particular strength in China, Singapore and Australia.
•	Latin America: Emerging tax incentives for energy efficient retrofits and growing commercial real estate activity create a fertile environment for modular IBMS deployments.
•	Middle East & Africa: Ultra modern skyscrapers in the Gulf and off grid developments in Africa drive demand for fault prediction algorithms and hybrid power orchestration.
